    "title": "Walmart Is Selling a Hiking Hat That 'Creates Lots of Shade' for Just $10 During Its Massive July Sale - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Men’s Journal aims to feature only the best products and services. If you buy something via one of our links, we may earn a commission. Right now we’re in the middle of Walmart Deal Days , where we’re finding everything from Legos and flip flops to fans and tough storage bins are on sale—typical Walmart fare. But, did you know that the event also has great hiking gear , with sleeping bags , camp chairs , flashlights , and hiking backpacks all marked down to great prices right now? You can even get this excellent hiking hat for just $10. The Einskey Hiking Hat is 50% off for deals week, comes in 13 styles, and has over 250 five-star ratings. This is an online-only deal, and one style has already sold out, so be sure to grab your favorite color before it sells out or the sale ends on July 13. This hat has a wide brim over 3 inches thick, providing great sun protection, plus it is water repellent in case you get caught in a sprinkle in the mountains. To counteract the hot sun, the hat’s sides are vented. Its adjustable chin strap and drawcord headband make it a one-size-fits-all affair, plus make it good for both windy springs and casual summer evenings. This hat is great for hiking, yard work, days at the beach, and just everyday summer wear. One shopper, who mentioned facing high heat in the Southwest, said, “I love the sun and this allows me to be more comfortable in the hot summer days of Arizona. I had several days last Summer where 115 degrees was not uncommon. So I was really glad when I found this hat while shopping online.” Another shopper discussed facing sunny days with a hat. “Its wide brim creates lots of shade, and it's comfortable.” The Einskey Hiking Hat is just one example of how Walmart Deal Days are giving you hiking gear at great prices. But it won’t be 50% off forever, so be sure to get yours now. Sign up for Men's Journal's Recommended By newsletter to get gear, fitness, and more deals delivered straight to your inbox.",
